"completed receipts only after acknowledgement."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4617
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Marshall checks current Cedar VM read, unique current placement "
"and fresh authenticated protocol-2 host stream independently of guest "
"terminal capability. Lilly checks its assigned stream caller and newest "
"runnable command, then binds a private single-link host log inode to "
