msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4621
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Marshall counts endpoint responses only after the privacy, health "
"and public machine-API prefilters; a mode-0640 cumulative snapshot in a "
"dynamic-user-owned, mode-0750 directory feeds a static Rust exporter using "
"the Marshall-only collector socket with a Nix-configured replica identity."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4625
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Marshall owns executor fences and transitions; the guest uses only"
" verified private HTTPS. Native exec_command forwards the existing "
"lease/stop callback before spawn and during authority polling. A separate "
"scoped collector owns the child, concurrently bounds both output streams and"
" enforces the 20-second deadline independently of a blocking lease RPC."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4629
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Marshall serves /bin/install.ps1 templated with the deployment's "
"SSH host trust (503 without it) and the windows-amd64 artifact with its "
"SHA-256 digest from the same manifest as the Unix targets. The installer "
"validates origin, zone and host against the issued values, requires an "
"OpenSSH client with hostname protection (9.6+), installs "
"Microsoft.OpenSSH.Preview with winget without asking when "
"%ProgramFiles%\\OpenSSH lacks one, and with one administrator approval "
"places %ProgramFiles%\\OpenSSH before the in-box 9.5 directory in the "
"machine PATH (resolved in the elevated process; declined elevation leaves "
"the machine PATH unchanged and points to overalls ssh) so the machine page "
"shows one ssh HOST command, verifies the digest, runs config-ssh --staged-"
"installer with the downloaded binary before installing it, and connects with"
" overalls ssh through the recorded client. The managed SSH block quotes "
"ProxyCommand as one double-quoted absolute path because Win32-OpenSSH runs "
"it without a shell. Updates use the same digest manifest and activate by "
"renaming the running executable aside."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4633
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Marshall.Threads owns the durable objective, mode, team visibility"
" and thread-to-machine binding. Compute owns VM admission/lifecycle and "
"Agents owns turns, model calls and tools. PostgreSQL transactions, row "
"locks, generation keys and Oban jobs coordinate durable thread changes. The "
"authenticated LiveView is a client of these domains."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4637
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: MarshallWeb.SecurityHeaders sets one Content-Security-Policy "
"(script-src 'self' alone; style-src keeps 'unsafe-inline' for the vendored "
"xterm.js and Mermaid renderers), Permissions-Policy, same-origin opener and "
"resource policies, nosniff, SAMEORIGIN framing and no cross-domain policies "
"before health, static files, the early /api refusals and the router. "
"MarshallWeb.NoIndex adds X-Robots-Tag on the same surfaces and the root "
"layout repeats it as a robots meta tag beside the disallow-all robots.txt. "
"Production sends HSTS max-age=63072000 with includeSubDomains and no "
"preload. The production session cookie is __Host-marshall (Secure, HttpOnly,"
" Path=/, no Domain, SameSite=Lax, signed and encrypted) and the remembered "
"credential is __Host-remember_me; MarshallWeb.BrowserSession owns the "
"options for Plug.Session, the LiveView socket and every forged-session test "
"or release probe, and expires legacy cookie names carried by a request. "
"Headers and cookies grant nothing: stored-login checks, Cedar and CSRF "
"tokens decide access, and user applications on *.apps.ghuntley.dev remain "
"same-site with Marshall."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4641
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Native helpers retain completion custody (the source-export lock; "
"the transfer-stream hostd lease) across descendant process groups/sessions; "
"direct leader exit does not prove cleanup."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4645
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Native state journals, ownership fences and physical readiness "
"receipts remain authoritative; observer ACKs cannot gate v2 actor progress."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4649
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Native user-run client configuration and guest-local state remain "
"separate from Marshall's platform agent loop; Lilly derives the VM binding "
"and Marshall grants current inference authority. Codex starts with no "
"approvals and danger-full-access; Claude starts with bypassPermissions and "
"no Bash sandbox. Guest OS, VM, network and Marshall boundaries remain "
"independent. Ubuntu retains the pinned offline application closure through "
"its registered GC root."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4653
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Nix configuration trusts only the pinned Overalls Cachix signing "
"key for the additional read substituter. The NixOS host catalog, NixOS "
"guests, kexec installer and Ubuntu nix-daemon share the declaration; fleet "
"publication uses a separately scoped SOPS token under ADR-0189, and guests "
"receive no publication credentials."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4657
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Nix provisions Grafana on Overalls loopback for operators. "
"Application candidates repeat source lifetime and sampling-clock guards; "
"ingress additionally requires fresh direct localhost source health. Guest "
"claims cannot enter those series."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4661
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Nix provisions stable dashboards and datasources; Grafana "
"authenticates the operator while its server-side datasource holds only "
"reader-scoped log-store authority."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4665
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Nix-owned measurement rosters and numeric diagnostic states; "
"operator Grafana and signed-in Marshall reads; independent read-only "
"loopback storage probe and one 15-bound Underclass duration histogram."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:4669
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Boundary: Official-source Nix package and broker bind exact boot "
"address/gateway, execution/release/account preface and reconciled UID. "
