#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:6106
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Host snapshot cleanup compares the durable dataset GUID and local nonce before\n"
"unmounting or destroying. Foreign or inherited markers, changed GUIDs, conflicting\n"
"mounts and unavailable inspection retain the descriptor without destructive work.\n"
"An unrecorded snapshot GUID does not prevent cleanup when the remaining native\n"
"proofs match. Confirmed absence removes intent; an absent snapshot with a claiming\n"
"mount refuses. Uncertain inspection after destruction retains intent for retry."
msgstr ""

