msgid ""
"Inside the image, the SYSTEM task\n"
"[`overalls-bootstrap.ps1`](repo:nix/domains/artifacts/guest/windows/overalls-bootstrap.ps1)\n"
"runs at every boot: it reaches MMDS over a temporary link-local address when the\n"
"stack has none, obtains a V2 session token, validates every field of `/lilly`\n"
"(including that the MAC is the adapter's), applies exactly the delivered `/32`\n"
"with an on-link route to the gateway and a default route through it, keeps DHCP\n"
"and IPv6 off, grows `C:` into host-added space, and records the applied identity\n"
"under `C:\\overalls\\network` without ever logging the token or challenge. The\n"
"Administrator credential, EMS and SAC are unchanged, so the serial login gap of\n"
"ADR-0169 stands."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:6220
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Inspect `overalls-auto-update` unit status and private phase records under\n"
"`/var/lib/overalls-auto-update`. Correct a failed candidate in a new revision after\n"
"identifying its failure. Preserve the enrolled receipt and storage baseline.\n"
"Topology, disk inventory, firmware and persistent identity changes are maintenance\n"
"operations, not ordinary timer updates."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:6224
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
