#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:6974
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Permissions are checked at execution time. Access shown in a previous list is\n"
"not a guarantee that a later operation is allowed. Sharing roles are `viewer`,\n"
"`operator` and `manager`; ownership and current permissions determine which\n"
"operations you may perform. SSH key commands affect only your own keys."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:6978
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Personal account reconciliation obtains a fresh boot-bound roster. Lilly may wait\n"
"up to one second for definite contention on the placement lock, then verifies the\n"
"same owned boot and confinement and renews its route and command checks. The guest\n"
"request retains its three-second deadline. Exhausted contention or unconfirmed\n"
"authority denies creation; an existing account never bypasses this proof."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:6982
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Personal integration admission requires an explicit source attachment even for\n"
"the owner. Current owning-team membership remains an independent team path.\n"
"Neither bypasses owner/team liveness, Customer exclusion or execution fences.\n"
"Generated histories verify refused management leaves mutation audit and durable\n"
"state unchanged, and actual account retirement/removal withdraw prior admission.\n"
"The packaged HTTP/1 lease guardian interrupts blocked frontend I/O by closing\n"
"the native socket while preserving request-owner cleanup. Its isolated upload\n"
"fault test measures EOF/reset and no retries; production timing and broader\n"
"connect/response fault permutations remain distinct gaps."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:6986
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Personal integration ownership grants management authority only. Every source\n"
"VM, including the owner's VM, needs an explicit attachment. Detach removes\n"
"admission and renewal authority; existing configurations receive no automatic\n"
"attachments or compatibility exemption. Personal-owner retirement and owning-team\n"
"archival refuse access despite retained rows. See [services](#services) for lease\n"
"cancellation and the distinction between current and historical acceptance."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:6990
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Physical IPv4 destination admitted for WireGuard handshakes."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:6994
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Physical/workflow sources commit admissions and terminal accounting with business\n"
"state in PostgreSQL. Original admission clocks, immutable deadlines, canonical\n"
"receipts and exact execution bindings fence completions. Retry success requires\n"
"both matching physical-running and committed-readiness evidence inside its\n"
"original window. Late readiness can update actual state without rewriting a\n"
"terminal measurement. Timeout settles accounting only; it cannot cancel work,\n"
"release reservations or change guest execution."
msgstr ""

