#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7319
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required preparation services that publish runtime secrets before startup."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7323
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: A bundle with guest_agents none never reports guest_ready:"
" trust is recorded as skipped for the exact boot, provisioning ends in the "
"terminal unattested phase (no boot UUID, no path to ready), and readiness, "
"terminal options, workspace sources and the Inception profile are refused "
"before any host effect. Marshall refuses terminal sessions, agent turns, the"
" agent executor binding, web search and Inception admission for such an "
"image, hides the corresponding controls, and admits only the physical "
"service level. An older Lilly fails closed on a firmware bundle, which is "
"why the converged push precedes any placement. Lilly's host policy drops "
"every unmarked packet between the host and a Customer guest, so nothing on "
"the host reaches the Windows guest except the SSH and editor ingress paths "
"it does not yet have. The guest bootstrap refuses an MMDS document whose "
"fields fail validation or whose MAC is not the adapter's and never logs the "
"token or boot challenge."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7327
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: A foreign Unix peer, malformed binding, unbounded or "
"forged outer metric, wrong route, and customer-profile private connection "
"must be refused."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7331
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: A full spool refuses new provider effects; an incomplete "
"admission cannot be acknowledged as completed usage or replayed as inference"
" after restart. A conflicting completion remains visible as its own class "
"and keeps the disputed receipt."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7335
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: A full64MiB ring reservation budget refuses new sessions "
