"Required refusal: Anonymous browsers redirect to sign-in; unknown viewer "
"events halt; insert credentials are refused on /select/*; reader credentials"
" are refused on /insert/*; unverified CA chains and plain unauthenticated "
"requests fail."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7391
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Anonymous or revoked readers cannot retain the page. "
"Missing seven-day history, sparse traffic, changed source lifetime, missing "
"host coverage, malformed or duplicate recordings and foreign labels remain "
"Unknown. Missing, duplicate, stale, failed or foreign burn rules cannot "
"display an inactive warning."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7395
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Any marker mismatch, changed, extra or missing managed "
"root, missing bundle block or link, or failed rebuild takes the full replace"
