msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7411
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Close4001 must refuse every pending caller as "
"unsupported_version, while draining4008 must remain a transient loss without"
