"Required refusal: Do not attribute an old flow to a new owner after address "
"reuse."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7439
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Do not reply success/failure, admit successor mutation or "
