"descendants retain writer refusal after helper SIGKILL."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7459
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Every non-hello first envelope closes with4005 while "
"identity stays nil and no tasks are dispatched."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7467
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Foreign or duplicate diagnostic rows, stale or missing "
"sources, unauthorized dashboard reads and incomplete duration history cannot"
