#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7479
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Foreign, late and duplicate completions cannot settle "
"admissions. Corrupt/missing initialized state, symlinks, concurrent writers "
