msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7495
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Idle identity must fail ECONNRESET after the event, "
"blocked calls must wake with errors, and FreeBSD must refuse new sockets "
"until VM replacement. Ordinary host peer disconnect alone cannot satisfy the"
" peerless-socket oracle; incomplete histories cannot emit a receipt."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7499
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Incomplete cache bodies or origin effects cannot count as "
"replay. Changed pool/parent GUIDs, missing exact marker bytes or absent "
"quota after reset fail the smoke. Fixture source filtering and synthetic "
"peers do not authorize production guest attribution or physical durability "
