#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7547
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Missing distribution/contract inputs or malformed, "
"colliding or exhausted system-account allocations refuse assembly. Helper "
"arguments, nonroot callers, symlink/foreign/writable parents or unsafe "
