#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7551
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Missing or inconsistent synthetic credentials, absent "
"migration, failed TLS or HTTPS readiness, unavailable SQL, stale or "
