"admissions and scans cannot double-count. A measurement timeout must not "
"release capacity, cancel work or replay provider effects."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7559
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Missing or malformed generations cannot manufacture "
