"and a different boot target cannot inherit live authority."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7595
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Never treat a readable restored database as current "
"production authority."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7599
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: New attempts at saturation receive unavailable without "
"task, receipt or measurement admission; same-attempt replay remains "
"available and different work for an active repository remains busy."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7603
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: No successor lease while a utility of the previous holder "
