#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7607
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Old host/gateway credentials must refuse fresh requests "
"after rotation; new gateway credentials must not adopt old-generation "
"sessions or allow a denied old-socket creation."
