#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7631
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Pre-binding refusals and guest OTLP uploads cannot add "
"successes; an ordinary Audi UID cannot connect to the isolated collector "
