#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7651
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse a new SMTP attempt after the delivery commits "
"delivered or expired; an uncertain earlier provider acceptance may be "
"duplicated with the same identity."
