"and restored Chat editors. Reject wrong "
"signature/key/hash/manifest/platform/engine/dependency/archive, incomplete "
"registry pagination and observed concurrent lock changes. Prepublication "
"failure preserves the old lock; postrename synchronization failure reports "
"durability uncertainty with complete new bytes potentially visible. Missing "
"project servers fail without bundled installer fallback. Workspace trust "
"never approves an envrc or grants Marshall admission."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7663
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse detached/nonmember authority, close a previously "
"renewed attempt and consume peer provenance only once. Archived owning teams"
" refuse despite retained memberships or attachments, and pending peer tokens"
" remain unconsumed."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7667
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse enrollment for recycled retired names, conflicting "
"registrations and unready or unfresh hosts; refuse stale compute and "
"inference credentials over every authenticated transport after retirement; "
"refuse all issuance, sessions, exchanges, enablement and admission on a "
"retired host forever."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7671
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse expired/replaced executor results and revoked CLI "
"use; never redispatch an uncertain command or turn an identical request "
"replay into new work."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7675
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse foreign or revoked readers, deleted VMs, stale or "
"unsupported host streams, missing or ambiguous placement, superseded "
"stop/delete/replacement commands, changed epoch/generation/incarnation, "
"missing launch witness and unsafe files. An older same-epoch launch attempt "
"permits only a still-running adopted execution with full confined-VMM "
"observation; failed adopted logs remain unavailable. Guest terminal session "
"creation/listing remains refused when capability is false."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7679
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse incomplete provenance, unavailable or placeholder "
"kernel artifacts, malformed or oversized probe frames, stale boot identity "
"and digest mismatch. Wrong-CID peers must be refused by the native "
"transport, but this has no recorded machine evidence."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7683
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse missing, altered, foreign, stock or unapproved "
"native identity before allocation or launch, including source-bearing "
"requests. Names, kernel digest and image ID alone cannot qualify an image. "
"Only exact reviewed FreeBSD d141e426 and OmniOS 98b23b identities qualify; "
"unqualified capability rows, editor, Inception and unrelated rebuilt "
"candidates remain disabled. Missing or replayed evidence/publication "
"refuses."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7687
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse missing/private-file custody, invalid fixture "
"schema, expired sign-in, wrong origin/UID/OS or failed "
"save/readback/preview. Late child success, skipped slots and "
"recorder/collector gaps cannot become healthy synthetic journeys."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7691
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse nonmanager mutations, stale execution, private "
"credentials, unapproved repository hosts, traversal, changed replay input "
"and unexpected digest. Fetching runs no hooks, filters, submodules or "
"installation scripts. Failed updates retain the active revision; managed "
"removal cannot erase personal or project skill files or locally edited "
"content."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7695
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse nonroot execution, caller-selected disks, foreign "
"or shrinking layouts, invalid CRCs, extra partitions, substituted pool "
"identity and failed native commands. Failure must withhold the root-growth "
"receipt and bootstrap authority."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7699
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse old flush, workspace and terminal authority after "
"restart. Refuse incomplete filesystem checks, corrupt or missing retained "
"bytes, an unobserved SIGKILL, reused boot identity or unclean final exit; "
"incomplete histories cannot publish a receipt."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7703
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse ordinary, locked, demoted or revoked actors and "
"archived/non-retryable jobs; changed request meaning cannot retry another "
"job."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7707
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse ordinary-user mutation, missing or stale role, "
"absent or expired receipt, missing first-enrollment email freshness, failed "
"or replayed ceremony, substituted arguments, another socket's continuation, "
"invalid current resource/generation, revoked login, proving-key removal and "
"elevated foreign Customer access. Staging and refused actions leave "
"privileged mutation and target-action audit rows unchanged; failed "
"assertions may consume their challenge, and successful verification retains "
"its separate security audit even if target admission refuses."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7711
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse oversized required instructions/current input, "
"orphaned tool groups, stale or incomplete checkpoint results and no-progress"
" compaction. Unknown native capability uses summary mode. A generated "
"summary cannot change trusted mode or permissions. Ambiguous claimed model "
"calls cannot be replayed automatically."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7715
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse pinning without current read access, on deleted "
"intent (vm_deleted) and past twenty pins (pin_limit); refuse browser, Fleet "
"workloads, SSH/Porsche rm and thread deletes while the owner holds a pin; "
"never let a shared user's pin fence deletion or a pin extend revoked access."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7719
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse private or conditional requests even when a public "
"range is cached; never publish short, overflowing, aborted or owner-"
"interrupted writes."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7723
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse retired users, inherited authority for fresh same-"
"email registrations, invalid canonical database names, duplicate "
"reservations, oversized batches and noncycling UID exhaustion; historical "
"database restore with newer retained disks is unsupported until reservations"
" and sequence reconcile."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7727
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse stale elevation/login, ordinary users, stale "
"workload revisions and readiness without fresh physical emptiness; pause "
"admits no new move."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7731
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse unknown or malformed zones with invalid_time_zone, "
"non-user actors with Forbidden and retired accounts with unauthorized; "
"required/security minute ticks first refuse revoked or expired persisted "
"logins. Never persist the browser zone, log the zone text, show a person's "
"local time without a saved zone, or add browser-only fields to SSH ls/show, "
"share show or team show."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7735
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse unregistered or retired recipients, protected-owner"
" edits, web-only thread roles, unauthorized recipient enumeration, viewer "
"prompts/writes, operator thread management, changed idempotency input and "
"stale request regrant. VM-only grants do not expose task transcripts. "
"Foreign-owner, retired or Customer bindings do not inherit thread grants. A "
"role cannot grant another user's personal shell or bypass current login, "
"execution or profile checks. Thread revocation removes only that authority "
"source; independent VM/team access may remain."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7739
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse unretained rekey identities, nonrecipient "
"decryption, unsafe custody and incompatible cutovers; preparation failure "
"preserves all originals and partial publication is reported for explicit "
"retry."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7743
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse unsafe linked instruction paths, stale digests, "
"malformed chunks, nonexistent creator profiles, stale execution and required"
" content beyond context limits. Skip linked skill directories with a "
"warning. Duplicate skill names require explicit identity; unsupported "
"connectors do not install automatically."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7747
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse viewer/web/revoked roles, foreign Customer "
"administrators, cross-account cookies/approval, replay, retirement, stale "
"login/grant, changed execution/release and expired/closed leases. Same-User "
"email changes preserve the guest account and editor origin. Safe stale-"
"cookie requests begin fresh authentication; current permission refusal "
"remains403 and unavailable execution or unanswered login lookup503."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7751
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Refuse withdrawn manager actions and queued activation, "
"changed request inputs, cancelled retries and cancellation after "
"publication; retain unknown cleanup holds. Retain transfer slots until both "
"endpoint revocation receipts; retain the source snapshot hold, the source "
"exclusion and the prune offer through cleanup uncertainty and past the "
"cleanup deadline; refuse stale recovery over newer source intent. Malformed "
"clone control JSON receives a permanent 400 invalid_message before host "
"state changes. Reject a clone or relocation claim while the host transfer "
"slot is occupied."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7755
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject a digest-diverging sample ID without acknowledging "
"the valid neighbors in its batch; only a committed history receipt may "
"acknowledge an ID."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7759
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject a model response containing any forbidden tool, "
"reject stale executor authority and a late completion after claim expiry, "
"and refuse changed prompt text under an already used request key without "
"another turn or wake."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7763
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject a wrong-boot trust exchange without changing "
"installed trust, service availability or durable receipt."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7767
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject absent, conflicting or revoked CA trust, mismatched"
" deployment inputs, revoked account keys and mismatched artifact digests."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7775
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject anonymous and revoked sessions, stale reviews, "
"invalid evidence and missing security layers. Reject missing architecture "
"views and stale domain/resource/host/placement inventories even with "
"refreshed receipts."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7779
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject direct guest SSH bypass, stale boot receipts, "
"deadline extension, corrupt journals, overwritten disks and unconfirmed "
"storage cleanup; retain the original mutation ID through uncertain replies. "
"Exact sealed identity changes refuse reuse; quarantined incarnations cannot "
"regain readiness and require fenced retirement plus full verification of a "
"distinct replacement."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7783
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject expired/replayed challenges and revoke authority "
"held by stale actors. Invalid or replayed magic links establish neither "
"login nor remembered authority."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7787
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject foreign and transferred-name creation without false"
" success, membership or audit writes."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7791
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject foreign gateway, epoch, placement, release, account"
" or username before worker startup. Never start an editor as root or inherit"
" another account's home. Unchanged identity preserves a live worker; changed"
" legitimate origin/release requires successful stop before replacement. "
"Metadata or foreign socket custody failure refuses without stopping it; "
"files remain retained."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7795
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject foreign or removed-team thread access, unsupported "
"agent profiles, invalid machine shapes, changed duplicate idempotency input,"
" prompts before readiness, stale authority during archive/delete/reopen, "
"mismatched transcript bindings, and prompt or terminal mutation against "
"archived machines. The resource and database require an explicit machine "
"admission key; malformed unkeyed provisioning and archive jobs are "
"cancelled. A stale provision job cannot resurrect a deleting or archived "
"thread or overwrite a new machine generation. Replacement admission waits "
"for physical cleanup."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7799
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject foreign principals, CA revocation, malformed or "
"expired certificates and stale/cross-VM boot bindings."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7803
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject foreign/revoked management, stale or changed "
"requests and mismatched evidence; retain holds until physical effects are "
"known. Stored VM source overrides supplied snapshot data. Unavailable source"
" capability after confirmed resize commits target sizes/proof, retains "
"disk/address, releases only confirmed stopped compute and completes a fixed "
"failure without blocking cleanup."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7807
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject forged mutation events and forged administrator "
"flags from ordinary users."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7811
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject illegal workflow transitions and superseded host "
"session nonces; retain holds while physical absence is unknown. Unavailable "
"source capability refuses recovery without rolling back valid physical crash"
" or host report evidence; confirmed stopped compute releases while "
"disk/address remain retained."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7815
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject incompatible candidates, retain explicit failed-"
"phase evidence, and recover an operator-switched active candidate by health "
"re-verification only."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7819
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject invalid files, missing or wrong fields, unsafe "
"socket paths and credential defects with exact invalid_configuration and a "
"catalogued event before reviewed startup entry points."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7823
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject invalid files, schemas, control origins, local "
"paths, provider selections and credential custody with exact "
"invalid_configuration and a catalogued rejection before reviewed startup "
"entry points."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7827
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject malformed mailboxes, header injection and replayed "
"tokens before account or guest authority; valid plus aliases, numeric-"
"leading local parts and root mailboxes remain eligible."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7831
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject malformed, unsafe, incompatible and internally "
"inconsistent required configuration with the fixed credential-free startup "
"error."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7835
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject ordinary/self/mismatched retirement, pre-retirement"
" links, copied revoked sessions and inherited credentials or grants; retain "
"disk holds during busy or unavailable execution."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7839
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject owner replacement, unauthorized or terminal "
"transfer transitions and stale authority after transfer/removal."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7843
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject proxy use of admin or invalid credentials and "
"malformed JSON outside the denominator; accounting saturation or uncertainty"
" prevents provider effects. Missing, stale or incomplete source observations"
" remain unknown rather than healthy."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7847
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject revoked keys, stale placements, wrong guest-account"
" bindings and inherited old identities; atomically refuse exhausted "
"allocation bounds."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7851
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject stale grants and prevent authority from surviving "
"revocation."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7855
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject stale login/session/execution authority, "
"expired/foreign/replayed tickets and writable input after downgrade; do not "
"replay uncertain input. A future output sequence closes the affected viewer "
"channel instead of silently stalling it."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7859
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject stale mounted/domain role, global-session, reset, "
"invitation and retirement mutations after authority loss without target, "
"token, credential, outbox/job, deletion or audit changes."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7863
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject stale observations and prevent physical usage from "
"being hidden by logical budgets."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7867
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject substituted paths when signatures are disabled or "
"the Overalls key is absent. A Cachix outage falls back to cache.nixos.org or"
" a local build; foreign images without Nix are outside this journey."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7871
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject unauthorized admission and Customer sharing, egress"
" and agent execution even when a user selects Customer explicitly."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7875
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject unrelated decryption keys, malformed manifests, "
"unavailable retained references, busy operator locks and unsafe or nonempty "
"restore targets; keep historical authority isolated."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7879
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject unsafe files, incompatible schemas, wrong role "
"fields and invalid listener/custody configurations with fixed "
"invalid_runtime_configuration and a catalogued rejection."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7883
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject untrusted keys, altered packages, "
"malformed/duplicate/oversized signatures and absent packaged keys. Registry "
"responses and user settings cannot disable verification; explicit local VSIX"
" imports retain a separate user trust decision."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7887
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject utility-framework classes, colour literals outside "
"the token file, external resource references, cross-origin requests, "
"horizontal overflow, off-grid layout on workspace routes and utility classes"
" on the public sign-in page."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7891
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reject wrong, duplicate, additional or encoded query "
"parameters, mismatched prefixes, non-POST methods and OpenAI beta queries "
"before provider effects. Disabled Anthropic returns provider_unavailable "
"before authority or spool access."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7895
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Require three refusals over the still-live readiness "
"channel while the flush daemon cannot restart. Refuse malformed "
"snapshot/mode/PID/hash framing and incomplete restoration; only the full "
"sequence may publish a receipt."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7899
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Retained editor-free images, a changed release or image "
"identity, missing package partner, insufficient headroom, unsafe "
"customization paths, foreign gateway/boot/account and revoked browser "
"authority must refuse. A Linux family capability or successful SSH does not "
"grant editor authority."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7903
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Retired fleet endpoints refuse before reading the body; "
"archived monitoring credentials cannot issue or acquire authority; extra "
"diagnostic completion fields fail the accounting schema."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7907
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Retired schedules cannot send an early replacement ping; "
"the replacement's own heartbeat must still progress."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7911
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Retirement-first registration leaves key, approval and "
"audit inventories unchanged; stale actors cannot add registrations after "
"cleanup completes."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7915
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Reviewed explicit wrong-version and malformed-message "
"classes halt without cookies or redirects; malformed monitor JSON returns "
"permanent 400 invalid_samples rather than unavailable 503. Both stream "
"refusals retain separate 404 behavior."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7919
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Source queries/fragments never enter capture storage/POST;"
" URL user information refuses there, and raw authority/path stays strict "
"backend input. Malformed or expired capture, missing CSRF, revoked or MFA-"
"pending identity creates no machine. Unsupported origins/routes, option-"
"shaped values, non-egress profiles, absent/obsolete/mismatched source "
"capability and changed source under one idempotency key refuse before "
"allocation. A stale completion cannot clear a newer observed capture. Stale "
"boots, source conflicts, foreign API clone origins, redirects and obsolete "
"stored sources refuse; a done marker cannot bypass stored-source validation."
" Supplied snapshots cannot replace the retained immutable image or recorded "
"source. Unavailable restart capability releases only confirmed stopped "
"compute and retains disk/address; confirmed resize completes a fixed source-"
"unavailable failure, preserving target sizes and ordinary cleanup."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7923
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Stopped, foreign, superseded, truncated, unsafe-mode or "
"hardlinked intent after lock waiting must refuse exec without the target "
"marker."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7931
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: The build fails without the OVERALLS-SETUP-COMPLETE serial"
" marker and the firmware build fails without the PVH note or the patched "
"aperture. The guest has a bootstrap Administrator credential and an "
"interactive SAC login on serial, which must not be mistaken for the Linux "
"console boundary. The manifest carries exactly the eight version-5 keys; a "
"display name or any version-4 field is refused by the protocol."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7935
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: The initial q35 image reached multi-user and answered port"
" 1026 flush but did not report readiness when its NIC appeared as enp0s3; "
"the net.ifnames=0 repair allowed the exact readiness check. A flush reply "
"alone cannot authorize readiness, and an emulator boot cannot authorize "
"hosted Lilly placement or native physical effects."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7939
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Unapproved or malformed requests never enter the "
"denominator; integration-host access to /slo is refused; guest identity and "
"integration names cannot become labels."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7943
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Unavailable physical health, absent private credential, "
"mismatched host/pool identity, disconnected Control or false execution "
"readiness cannot be treated as schedulable capacity. A positive ZFS sample "
"alone cannot prove guest readiness, native KVM isolation or crash recovery."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7947
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Under policy refuse sibling, private, protected-uplink, "
"gateway and unregistered fixed-service TCP targets and foreign-source "
"traffic while preserving public access and current private SSH authority. "
"Require assigned-source recovery after the foreign-source test."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7951
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Underclass refuses to start before the egress node is "
"logged in with the exit node selected; its unit cannot reach any non-"
"loopback address directly; a lost exit node fails requests rather than "
"falling back to the host's own address."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7955
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Unknown OS values, cross-OS agent sets, extra keys, "
"malformed boot arguments and out-of-bound artifacts are refused. A metadata "
"or focused jail test must not be treated as a native guest boot or fleet "
"result."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7959
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Unknown and duplicate responses cannot settle another "
"caller; ninth pending request returns busy without dispatch; dropped batches"
" return unproven."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7963
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Unknown children, foreign or corrupt claims/owners/GUIDs, "
"unsafe mounts/drives/boot-file custody, damaged disk metadata, exceeded "
"artifact bounds and unexpected files continue to withhold the pool. An "
"invalid launch bundle cannot grant allocation credit, readiness, execution, "
"image admission, metadata conversion or deletion authority. Recognition of "
"retained storage cannot authorize guest access or physical cleanup."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7967
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Unproved keys, malformed selectors, denied or malformed "
"grants and diagnostic guidance cannot add outcomes; ordinary Audi UID cannot"
" enter the collector socket; exporter cannot replace the source snapshot, "
"and key, account and VM identity cannot become metric labels."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7971
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Unresolved attribution, policy refusal, malformed request,"
" stale or foreign snapshot and nonmonotonic counters must not improve the "
"candidate success ratio."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7975
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Unreviewed names, mismatched objective labels and HTTP "
"destinations must not deliver; unprivileged users cannot read private "
"runtime credentials."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7979
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Unsupported or malformed locale input cannot persist; a "
"foreign user cannot change the preference; old Porsche protocol peers fall "
"back to English; JSON fields, protocol identifiers and terminal bytes remain"
" language-neutral."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7983
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Viewers and revoked actors cannot answer or implement. "
"Child agents cannot ask human questions. Stale, cancelled, archived or "
"nonactive requests refuse. Competing answers cannot overwrite a winner, "
"changed replay inputs conflict and partial proposal output cannot be "
"implemented. Mode changes while work runs or awaits answers refuse."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7987
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: When every eligible account is still cooling after the "
"reset attempt, the request is refused with 429 and Retry-After equal to the "
"seconds until the earliest cooling deadline; no credential or prompt enters "
"the saturation log."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7991
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Withdrawn membership refuses code exchange, fresh opening "
"and renewal; closed or expired streams cannot revive after re-addition. "
"Customer and foreign authority remain refused."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7995
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Withheld read credit and independent quiet slave owners "
"cannot extend killed session registration or hold ring/viewer permits; "
"killed writers receive socket shutdown."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7999
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Withhold cleanup completion while adopted children in "
"another session remain live; uncertain wait errors refuse success."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8007
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Wrong Grafana credentials are refused. Zero current "
"admitted traffic, stale source markers, absent completion ratio, any "
"admitted request without a duration, or duration beyond the last finite "
"bucket removes the p95 candidate instead of showing a reassuring latency "
"value."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8011
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Wrong UID or exact unit refuses even with socket-group "
"access; quota and malformed input cannot evict acknowledged archive bytes; "
"unavailable observers cannot stop producer work."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8015
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Wrong credentials, anonymous operator reads, foreign Host "
"and untrusted direct backend/query-store access refuse."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8019
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: Wrong operator credentials and remote-node access to "
"Grafana refuse; missing, stale, too-young or wrong-host source markers "
"withhold the candidate ratio, including when an older recording survives a "
"Prometheus restart."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8023
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: hostd refuses a received descriptor that is not an "
"unconnected, non-listening AF_UNIX stream socket and paths outside its "
"socket roots, and ends the session on a descriptor with any other request, a"
" missing descriptor or more than one."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8027
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required refusal: hostd refuses an op 14 whose preface exceeds 4096 bytes, "
"whose expected frame exceeds 256 bytes or whose ready wait is not 0 without "
"a frame and 1..30000 ms with one, and starts no bridge when the guest "
"closes, stays silent past the wait or sends any other frame. Editor sign-out"
" still closes the WebSocket at Audi, which ends the bridge; a restarted "
"Lilly ends unrecorded bridges and recorded ones whose execution is not "
"current within 30 s. Marshall answers editor and web renewal while Lilly "
"reconnects with unavailable, which Audi retries only inside the unchanged "
"lease; sign-out, revoked write, stop, a newer generation and a stale report "
"stay conclusive refusals."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8031
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Required runtime fields are validated before mirror workers or listeners start.\n"
"Non-string JSON bind values return fixed configuration refusal and the\n"
"catalogued `enrico.startup_rejected` event rather than raising during conversion.\n"
"Generated local properties pass 96 fresh refusals across 32 invalid cases and\n"
"40 read-only non-string-bind checks. Refusals preserve recursive fixture bytes,\n"
"permissions, link counts and ownership, including the fixture root; diagnostics\n"
"exclude synthetic credentials and paths. The separate unset control starts an\n"
"empty supervisor. These are test-build startup checks; packaged TLS startup,\n"
"successful configured serving, concurrent file replacement and hosted config\n"
"faults remain open for this property. Valid loading can create the state directory;\n"
"the non-string-bind loader property checks refusal before that side effect."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8035
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Required services publishing runtime TLS files before proxy startup."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8039
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Resize is also scriptable and cancellable (ADR-0166). Porsche\n"
"`resize MACHINE [--cpu N] [--memory MIB] [--disk GIB]` resolves only the\n"
"machine and delegates sizes, generation fencing, holds and manage\n"
"authorization to the domain; an omitted option keeps the current size and a\n"
"request with no size option is refused. Its receipt pins the resize request and\n"
"follows the phases (complete succeeds; a cancel receipt succeeds and the\n"
"original is superseded; a finished failure fails; a retryable failure keeps the\n"
"receipt accepted), and `request retry` / `request cancel` act on it. Every\n"
"refused resize, retry or cancel is logged as `vm.resize_refused` with its closed\n"
"reason. A stop receipt that confirms the guest down without its disk is\n"
"recorded on the request as `physical_state_unconfirmed` with every hold\n"
"retained, not refused as an invalid outcome. While the request is still\n"
"stopping and not fenced, the owner may cancel: the original holds are restored\n"
"at once, the pending stop is awaited in a cancelling phase, an originally\n"
"running machine restarts through an ordinary start with its unchanged sizes and\n"
"the request finishes as cancelled when it runs (`vm.resize_cancelled`); an\n"
"originally stopped machine finishes as cancelled on the stop receipt. Once sizes\n"
"are being applied, cancellation is refused and retry remains the only path; the\n"
"page offers the control only while stopping and shows the cancelling stages."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8043
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Resize records the requested shape and expected generation. The workflow stops the\n"
"guest, applies supported resource changes, and restarts when required. Disk growth\n"
"must preserve the owned drive and filesystem; this is not a general shrink tool.\n"
"Concurrent incompatible operations are rejected or reconciled by the coordinator."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8047
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Restart readiness preserves `storage_busy` from native usage observations as well\n"
"as pool-lock contention. Same-pool incoming storage defers readiness only while\n"
"its stream may still be writing: an active private import journal, native owner\n"
"nonce/GUID and destination identity match, with no ordinary placement claim, and\n"
"the receive has not finished. A finished, unadopted import is validated as a\n"
"staged child under receive policy (read-only, `noauto`, unmounted, with its\n"
"journal-fixed snapshots), so a neighbour such as a clone's source restarts before\n"
"the copy is adopted; if counters are still settling, restart defers. A validated unbound receiving intent\n"
"also defers while its dataset and mountpoint are absent, before its stream starts;\n"
"a missing previously bound dataset does not qualify. Adoption ends this deferral. The target\n"
"bundle, disk metadata, native ownership and mounts must validate first; unknown\n"
"imports do not become retryable. Full snapshot/accounting validation still runs\n"
"before launch. This grants no transfer authority or capacity credit.\n"
"The import deferral probe checks parent identity, policy and healthy backing\n"
"independently of usage decomposition, which may be inconsistent during receive.\n"
"All normal pool inspection and accounting still require coherent counters."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8051
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Restored Lilly actors resume physical reconciliation when the current\n"
"authenticated control session connects. Collector acceptance and Tempo\n"
"availability do not gate actor startup, command dispatch, state transitions or\n"
"physical outcome acknowledgements.\n"
"The [recovery property](repo:lilly/test/lifecycle/recovery_history_test.exs)\n"
"reopens persisted execution histories and observes restored actor dispatch\n"
"without a diagnostic sender. Its control result and executor are synthetic;\n"
"authenticated transport, full Runtime bootstrap and native VMM lifetime remain\n"
"outside this scoped evidence."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8055
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Restoring an older database alongside newer retained guest disks is unsupported\n"
"until its guest UUID/UID reservations and sequence have been reconciled against\n"
"all retained state. A database restore can omit later identities whose files still\n"
"exist on disks, so the restored sequence alone cannot prove a UID is unused.\n"
"No external reservation registry or automatic historical-restore reconciliation\n"
"is implemented by this change. Both generated-identity guest lifecycle\n"
"journeys passed retirement, physical cleanup and retained shared home/process\n"
"checks on base `63a1443c` plus the durable feature before main integration.\n"
"Separate incoming `d4499c4c` merged eight-subtest lifecycle captures also passed\n"
"on NixOS (438.33 seconds) and Ubuntu (574.18 seconds); neither reconciles a\n"
"historical restore or establishes later incoming source. Complete Ubuntu SSH and\n"
"native editor acceptance retain their separate gaps under\n"
"[ADR-0158](repo:docs/architecture/decisions/0158-durable-guest-identities.md)."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8059
