#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8237
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Sensitive operations and expected refusals: the Special Administration Console\n"
"on COM1 accepts an interactive login, unlike the Linux `no-serial-login-shell`\n"
"contract. For the agentless image this remains a recorded gap; the `windows-v1`\n"
"roster agent rotates the bootstrap Administrator to a random unrecorded password\n"
"and disables it after the first activated roster account (ADR-0171 gate 3).\n"
"The guest bootstrap runs as SYSTEM, reads\n"
"only MMDS, validates every field (including the adapter MAC) and never logs the\n"
"session token or boot challenge. The evaluation-ISO build must never be pointed\n"
"at production media without the licence review in `iso.json`."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8241
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Separate SOPS documents and atomically published application bundles."
