#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:10556
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Unattended Marshall candidates must retain the database URL, shared cookie and\n"
"token-signing authority. A candidate Cloak ring may add keys or reorder inactive\n"
"keys, up to sixteen entries, while retaining the active key and every prior\n"
"key's ID and bytes. Removal, promotion and material replacement require coordinated\n"
"maintenance. Preflight compares the staged candidate with every serving local\n"
"Marshall environment. It reads the installed environment file only when none\n"
"are serving; replacing that file cannot approve a candidate against older live\n"
"authority. Correct a refused candidate explicitly and submit it again."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:10560
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Unavailable source capability refuses automatic restart while committing the\n"
"confirmed crash or resize outcome and any valid host report. Confirmed stopped\n"
"compute is released; disk and network address remain retained. A confirmed resize\n"
"keeps its target sizes and completes with `workspace_source_unavailable`, allowing\n"
"ordinary deletion and recreation on a current image. Unconfirmed effects retain\n"
"their existing holds and fencing requirements. The final focused SQL-backed set\n"
"passed 39 checks (3 properties, 36 tests), including six new source/snapshot\n"
"regressions and editor publication; native recovery acceptance remains separately\n"
"scoped in the [review](repo:docs/architecture/reviews/2026-10-10-browser-launcher.md)."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:10564
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Underclass keeps one durable totals record in its admission journal\n"
"(`slo-totals.sqlite`). Its single duration histogram has fifteen finite bounds\n"
"through twenty-four hours and is the only Underclass p95 source; the exporter\n"
"refuses any other bound set. No code reads or converts the retired seven-bound\n"
"`slo.sqlite`, so source lifetime and metric continuity restarted with the new\n"
"journal. Terminal removal and aggregate changes commit together. Unknown recovery\n"
"duration stays unmeasured, and overflow beyond the last finite bucket remains\n"
"unavailable."
msgstr ""

