#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:1641
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"**Gaps:** Fleet proofs on 2026-10-15 cover creation to ready in seconds, "
"trust, roster accounts and sshd, the host certificate, executor "
"registration, a public workspace clone and a relocation between hosts "
"(review). Still unproven: an SSH login through Audi, a roster-user ConPTY "
"terminal under an S4U logon and an agent turn (they need a browser-approved "
"key), crash restart of the scheduled-task agents, the pool-level refill with"
" an uncacheable image configured, and no Marshall-driven Windows fleet test "
"makes any of the fleet proofs repeatable; ConPTY re-renders terminal output."
" The staged editor runtime/source and broker custody model retain separate "
"cross-link and bounded native library evidence; no native Windows "
"listener/account/task VM journey, admitted image, browser origin or editor "
"sign-in/edit/readback/recovery evidence is recorded."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:1653
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"**Gaps:** Full changed-source fleet execution and native image qualification"
" are in progress. Existing socket migration, physical isolation, host power-"
"loss and production deployment are not established by local application "
"properties."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:1765
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"**Gaps:** Native Windows SAM/S4U/profile and executable/PATH lifecycle "
"custody, sustained/interrupted overlapped cancellation, task crash/reboot "
"supervision, exact bundle/image qualification, two-account browser "
"separation, edit/readback, revocation, broker adoption and worker-loss "
"recovery remain unrecorded. Guest administrator authority and physical "
"isolation are separate boundaries."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:1989
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"**Gaps:** Production rollout and complete cross-OS native Git commit "
"acceptance remain unrecorded."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:2105
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"**Gaps:** The original Arch broker-restart502 remains unexplained despite a "
"complete same-image passing replay. Six recv/closed diagnostics also "
"occurred in successful recovery stages. Failure-only memory/OOM/PID/Node "
"probes did not execute. Native acceptance of later merged trunk and "
"production browser sign-in/history remain separate; current NixOS/Ubuntu "
"package, descriptor, broker or eligibility evidence does not close that "
"browser gap. Existing seven-family receipts retain earlier image IDs. "
"Retained disks are not upgraded; physical isolation and Windows/native "
"BSD/illumos editor support remain explicitly refused rather than inferred "
"from readiness, terminal, agent or SSH evidence."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:2153
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"**Gaps:** Two-writer native origin/UID separation, broader stale-"
"account/lease histories, physical host faults and multi-gateway failover "
"remain unexecuted. Earlier Ubuntu prompt/workbench/closure failures "
