#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:8895
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Tested scope: Protocol tests pin the capability table and the windows-v1 "
"manifest and bundle vectors; Lilly tests pin the agentless jail "
