#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:9075
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Tested scope: The shared Alma/Arch builder packages the pinned "
"editor/broker/direnv, exact descriptor, registered offline closure and GC "
