#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:6800
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Language headers and session values are untrusted, bounded and validated "
"against the supported locale set. Only the current user may persist their "
"override; reset restores browser negotiation. Neither locale nor text "
"direction changes login, Cedar, execution fences, storage ownership or "
"recovery authority. The Porsche envelope carries a canonical locale for "
"human prose, with English fallback for older peers; machine identifiers and "
"terminal byte streams stay unchanged. Bidi isolation protects interpolated "
"identifiers from misleading direction changes. See "
"[ADR-0201](repo:docs/architecture/decisions/0201-localized-human-"
