#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7007
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Managed guest files live under `/workspace/.overalls/skills/<thread>/<installation>`\n"
"on Linux and `C:\\workspace\\.overalls\\skills\\<thread>\\<installation>` on Windows.\n"
"Immutable content lives in `revisions/<content-digest>`; bounded operation\n"
"receipts live in `operations/<operation-id>.json`. The receipt stores request\n"
"fingerprints, identifiers, digests, paths and closed outcomes, not source URLs,\n"
"command arguments, provider bodies or Git streams. Status rereads verify current\n"
"content; `local_changes` preserves an edited revision. A pending receipt is an\n"
"uncertain operation and does not authorize repeating installation."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7032
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Marshall holds sensitive Cloak-encrypted access/refresh credentials and stable\n"
"numeric external identity. Active numeric identity is unique across Marshall\n"
"accounts. Shared writers use the owner's authority without receiving the token.\n"
"An absent, detached, disconnected or reconnect-required connection permits fresh\n"
"anonymous public forwarding without a token. Active drain/refresh refuses fresh\n"
"admissions. Existing authenticated leases cannot change identity or become\n"
"anonymous. GitHub remains responsible for repository, organization,\n"
"SAML SSO and consent policy."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7060
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Marshall supplies a current trusted developer instruction selected by the "
"stable thread configuration owner. Attribution defaults on and requests "
"exactly one Co-authored-by: Overalls <noreply@overalls.dev> trailer while "
"preserving other trailers. Disabling attribution supersedes earlier "
"attribution instructions. Existing commits are not rewritten. This "
"instructional policy does not intercept Git or guarantee model compliance.\n"
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7084
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Marshall's serving, migration, operator and pre-start release commands use the\n"
"same module-selected mail environment. The GitHub restore-credential invalidation\n"
"pre-start command must apply it before evaluating runtime configuration; inherited\n"
"remote SMTP settings cannot override an enabled local relay. Environment removal\n"
"options precede assignments, including the optional executor bootstrap manifest.\n"
"A source-built release and successful migrations do not establish successful\n"
"pre-start execution, activation, fresh control reports or ordinary CLI routing.\n"
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7092
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Matching `services.marshall.githubBootstrapRelease` and\n"
"`services.ziggy.githubBootstrapRelease` provide public source-built executor\n"
"artifacts for retained machines that lack the tool capability. Marshall receives\n"
"`MARSHALL_EXECUTOR_BOOTSTRAP_MANIFEST_FILE`. The closed inventory and fixed\n"
"bootstrap program remain separate from tool-installation authority and receipts."
msgstr ""

