#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7150
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Mutations have no automatic retry or redirect following. GET/HEAD redirects are\n"
"limited to three reviewed hops under the same lease; signed storage receives no\n"
"OAuth bearer. LFS action headers/URLs stay in short-lived Galileo memory behind\n"
"opaque method/execution/generation-bound selectors. Their lifetime is at most\n"
"sixty seconds and no later than provider expiry; mutation selectors have one\n"
"winner. JSON rewriting stops at eight MiB/thirty-two levels; binary bodies stream."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7235
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"New identity-bearing admissions require an image manifest advertising "
"`git_identity_version: 1`. Old firmware agents reject unknown MMDS fields, "
"so artifacts and consumers must be upgraded before enabling these "
"admissions. An older image without this capability refuses new machine "
"creation rather than receiving incompatible boot metadata. Existing machines"
" without an identity snapshot continue to omit the metadata. Native "
"reviewed-image qualification remains a separate requirement."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7263
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"NixOS exposes `services.marshall.github.clientId`, `clientSecretFile` and\n"
"`redirectUri`, all defaulting to `null`. Configure all three or none. The unit\n"
"wrapper removes inherited GitHub settings, supplies only module values and loads\n"
"the secret through a systemd credential. Partial module configuration fails\n"
"evaluation; the runtime independently validates complete values and callback\n"
"syntax. No callback-host equality with the configured Marshall origin is implied."
msgstr ""

