#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7540
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Peach is a separately packaged local service behind Audi's private Unix-socket\n"
"frontend, using its own unprivileged user and host-bound control credential.\n"
"Marshall's Peach domain retains only credential digests; it builds each bounded\n"
"projection from current Compute and integration authority. Peach/database loss\n"
"withholds reflection rather than serving a retained snapshot. The source module\n"
"and evaluation test exist, but the host inventory does not yet declare Peach\n"
"enabled. Audi's mandatory Lilly, Ziggy and Galileo dependencies remain; disabled\n"
"Peach emits a null optional socket and reflection refuses before execution\n"
"admission. A configured backend requires a bounded canonical Unix-socket path.\n"
"The public placement projection includes the Peach role without serializing its\n"
"credential or runtime configuration. Enabled socket access and credential\n"
"lifetime still need review and native execution."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7544
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Peach serves the bounded, secret-free `reflection.internal` projection for a\n"
"currently running guest. Marshall remains the authorization authority and\n"
"returns only integrations eligible for the fenced execution."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7585
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Pin a machine to the top of your lists. Your owner pin wakes it, prevents "
"automatic suspension, and prevents deletion."
