#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7596
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Plain-text HTTP refusal messages use the negotiated locale for repository launch,\n"
"installer/download and trust failures, editor/sign-in failures, inference/raw Git\n"
"access and missing documentation. Status codes, final newlines and generic\n"
"redaction remain unchanged. Successful installer scripts, archives, manifests,\n"
"checksums, trust JSON, CSV fields and raw Git bytes retain their machine format.\n"
"Public documentation and download routes negotiate without creating sessions.\n"
"Plain-text responses carry no HTML direction attribute; HTML RTL and native\n"
"browser acceptance remain separate verification boundaries."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7609
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Porsche catalog verification compares all 25 terminal catalogs with the "
"extracted message inventory and checks placeholders. The recorded full "
"Porsche gate at `1f79f63e6` passed 108 tests and Dialyzer with zero errors. "
"This establishes bounded BEAM/catalog behavior; native SSH onboarding, "
"visual bidi behavior and native-language quality still require separate "
