#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7885
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Reflection reveals bounded machine metadata and eligible integration descriptors,\n"
"never credential values. [ADR-0203](repo:docs/architecture/decisions/0203-guest-reflection.md)\n"
"keeps projection and credential authority in Marshall. Peach does not own a\n"
"database or retained snapshot authority."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:7889
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Refresh starts ten minutes before access expiry. Stop new old-generation\n"
"admissions, drain existing requests for at most five minutes, then withdraw\n"
"remaining leases before exchange. Current-attempt settlement atomically publishes\n"
"the replacement pair. Provider waits stay outside database transactions. An\n"
"uncertain rotating exchange requires reconnect; duplicate workers, old replies\n"
"and revoked callbacks cannot restore a generation."
