"remains. Mixed old/new Marshall releases and rollback to email naming are\n"
"unsupported. All serving instances and compatible fresh guest images must agree."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:10387
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
