msgid ""
"Timestamps on the overview, machines, threads, git, usage, SSH-key and\n"
"Control room pages render through `<.timestamp>` or equivalent semantic markup: the text is the viewer's local\n"
"time with its zone abbreviation (`2026-10-18 19:42 ACDT`) and the element keeps\n"
"the UTC instant in `datetime` and in the hover title. This includes the two-line\n"
"thread activity time and ingress route/certificate expirations. The thread activity\n"
"filters (today, week, month) compare calendar days in the viewer's zone. The JS\n"
"relative-activity labels stay relative."
msgstr ""

#: lib/marshall/documentation_messages.ex:10996
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Token ciphertext needs Marshall's matching Cloak keyring. A historical backup\n"
"may contain a refresh token consumed after backup, so decryption does not prove\n"
"current provider authority. An exchange can rotate upstream before its reply or\n"
"local commit is lost. Such uncertainty enters `reconnect_required` instead of\n"
"blindly retrying the old token."
msgstr ""

