"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `overalls` | Control plane and worker: one Marshall instance, local PostgreSQL, public web proxy, Porsche and Enrico, plus provisioner and guest services, diagnostic log store, Prometheus, Tempo and loopback Grafana behind an authenticated public HTTPS frontend on port 3443. Loss of this host removes the declared control-plane authority and both central telemetry query paths; collection on the worker remains independent. |\n"
"| `dungarees` | Worker using Overalls authority, with its own Lilly, guest storage, private services and OpenTelemetry collector; also a public Audi gateway and DNS replica. It deliberately has no Marshall, PostgreSQL, web proxy, Porsche or central telemetry store. |"
